comments[10]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-16T12:12:22.062Z",codex-sol,"Merged current main and retained both caller pins. No failing checks at the inspected PR head. Thread PRRT_kwDOSYpLFc63oZTO is a valid conditional concern: GITHUB_TOKEN merges do not start push workflows. Current read-only APIs show allow_auto_merge=true, required checks strict=false and no applicable branch rules. Both pinned callees refuse auto-merge unless required checks enforce freshness (sync lines 770-785; closeout lines 738-753), so it is currently unarmed. Refuse credential or repository-setting changes forbidden by this task, and do not disable CI dispatch with empty ci-workflows. Record the caveat without claiming the future token behavior is solved."
  "2026-11-16T12:23:26.337Z",codex-sol,"Read-only GraphQL confirms requiresStatusChecks=true and requiresStrictStatusChecks=false; applicable branch rules list is empty. This corroborates the current auto-merge refusal guard for the unresolved review thread. Exact caller-contract test, typecheck and tracker validation pass. The repository defines no npm lint script. Retried dependency-gated commands only after npm ci completed; quick npm suite remains running."
  "2026-11-16T12:30:18.019Z",codex-sol,"Prepared verification commit 2ce0ff9 records exact caller tests and disposition of PRRT_kwDOSYpLFc63oZTO. The current freshness guard prevents arming token-based auto-merge; no credential or settings change is made. Typecheck, caller contract, tracker validation and changelog:check pass. Quick npm tests remain running."
  "2026-11-16T12:36:40.118Z",codex-sol,"Complete PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick npm test exited 1: 320 tests, 319 pass, 1 fail, 0 cancelled/skipped/todo, duration 1094793 ms. Failure is test/persistence-context.test.ts:81: concurrent atomic import reports a live sdk-workspace-transaction lock after waiting 3077 ms and unconfirmed rollback. Focused retry also fails with the same lock at 3071 ms (1 test, 0 pass, 1 fail). Follow-up pm-jira-shared-transaction-wait owns this unchanged runtime failure. Caller tests, typecheck and changelog checks pass; no broad-suite success is claimed."
  "2026-11-16T19:28:43.804Z",codex-sol,"Root cause verified: pm-ops 2026.11.14 report() emits unverified-offline; attestation deferred when canonical tag lookup cannot verify the reusable caller pin. The checkout and origin/main retain an assertion requiring the local-publisher attested sentence. PM_OPS_OFFLINE=1 reproduces deterministically; no pin-sync change caused this pre-existing main failure. Keep structured recognition, explicit deferral and local unattested-publish refusal coverage."
  "2026-11-16T19:35:05.376Z",codex-sol,"Review Q validation: origin/main 6837fb135b00cd34df0f9546fbb0d1c80a6aef4c reproduces the same stale assertion with PM_OPS_OFFLINE=1. Updated the consumer contract and added a synthetic future-pin offline regression plus adjacent unattested-publisher refusal. Offline and online targeted workflow/attestation tests each pass 15/15; linked pm tests pass both commands (1 caller test and 15 workflow/attestation tests). npm run typecheck and npm run changelog:check pass. package.json defines no lint script or lint configuration; git diff --check passes, without claiming a lint run. Full suite remains delegated to CI."
  "2026-11-16T19:35:50.014Z",codex-sol,"Review Q implementation commit: d4a0335 (consumer contract and regression tests, with tracker history). Validation commands: npm run typecheck; node --test test/verify-release-publish-attestation.test.ts test/release-workflow.test.ts, both online and with PM_OPS_OFFLINE=1; pm test pm-jira-pmgh-pin-1115 --run --progress --timeout 180; npm run changelog:check; git diff --check. All pass. No item or review thread was closed."
  "2026-11-16T19:45:04.198Z",codex-sol,"Pushed commits d4a0335 and f79afae; exact published PR212 head is f79afaec8dc088303fd2949b50b299275b88999a. PR body was read back and verified, including the main reproduction and deferred-attestation contract. CI run 43941090021 is cancelled: test22 job 133558456957 and test26 job 133558456399 executed zero steps; log API endpoints return HTTP404. No new test failure is established and no rerun was requested. The renewed shared-runner hold expires at 2026-11-16T21:00:00Z, beyond the last-push cutoff 2026-11-16T20:06:18Z; this additional receipt remains local rather than bypassing the hold."
  "2026-11-17T01:51:22.706Z",codex-sol,"Review round AA: pulled and verified the open PR head. Source inspection confirms changelog dependencies can drift when main gains linked Dependabot merges. Plan: merge origin/main, regenerate with the documented changelog command, then check caller pins and types."
  "2026-11-17T02:02:13.083Z",codex-sol,"Merged origin/main as requested. Before regeneration, changelog:check reproduced the missing Dependencies link to PR #215. npm run changelog:full generated the link; CHANGELOG.md was never hand-edited. npm run typecheck, node --test test/pm-github-callers.test.ts (1 passed), and npm run changelog:check all passed through pm test --run --only-last --progress. No caller pins changed. Full-suite certification remains with CI."
